  "description": "Armaf Island Bliss is a smooth tropical-fresh fragrance that blends creamy sweetness with masculine woods, creating a scent that feels relaxed, confident, and effortlessly attractive. The opening delivers a fresh tropical burst with juicy citrus and creamy coconut, giving it an immediate vacation-ready feel. The heart introduces smooth aromatic and woody notes that add masculine balance and structure. The base settles into warm woods, musk, and soft sweetness, leaving a long-lasting, addictive trail that feels clean, modern, and seductive. Island Bliss is perfect for men or anyone who wants a tropical signature scent that stands out while remaining smooth and wearable.",
